# cabin_lit_bank: a bank of three tall windows lit from inside at night
# (decision 38): lamp light (24, paper cream that ignores the night) in the
# panes, deepening to warm spill (28, brick) low in the room; the mullions
# and the chairs in front stay dark, so they stand against the glow. Placed
# at at_win_left, and flipped at at_win_right (the banks and their chairs
# mirror). The anchor, 0,0, is the bank's top left corner.
